# Dappled sun flecks through swaying leaves on light themes, moonlight through branches on dark. ~15 fps.

# LEAF_STRENGTH: overall strength; LEAF_SWAY: sway speed, 0 holds still;
# LEAF_SCALE: higher gives smaller canopy gaps; FLECK_CELLS: higher gives more, smaller sun flecks.
startgroup
    animation_step 66
    var float LEAF_STRENGTH 1.0
    var float LEAF_SWAY 1.0
    var float LEAF_SCALE 2.6
    var float FLECK_CELLS 9.0
    shaders komorebi
endgroup
